#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:714
msgid ""
"Interpolates a 1D ramp defined by control points at ``param``. Control "
"points are specified by triples of parameters ``pos_i``, ``val_i``, and "
"``interp_i``."
msgstr ""
"Interpola la rampa en 1D definida pels punts de control en el ``param``. Els "
"punts de control s'especifiquen mitjançant triples dels paràmetres "
"``pos_i``, ``val_i`` i ``interp_i``."

